# Build context for the root (introspection) Dockerfile only — BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of .dockerignore, which belongs to
# docker/heavy-solvers/Dockerfile (#339). Allow-list: just what this Dockerfile COPYs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!TRADEMARKS.md
!MANIFEST.in
!MIGRATION.md
!ankusdrive/**
!scripts/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
